{
    "title": "Contacts",
    "description": "<b>Upgrade Your Calling Experience with Samsung's Phone Dialer & Contacts!</b> \ud83d\udcf2\r\n\r\nTransform your phone app experience with Samsung's official Phone Dialer & Contacts tool. Embrace efficiency and style in managing your contacts and calls.\r\n\r\n<b>Effortless Contact Management:</b>\r\n\r\n<b>One-stop shop</b>: Easily view, edit, call, and add new contacts in a single place.\r\n<b>Powerful suggestions</b>: Keep your contact list organized and up-to-date.\r\n<b>Social connectivity</b>: Seamlessly connect with friends across various platforms.\r\n<b>Merge and clean</b>: Combine duplicate contacts and remove unwanted ones effortlessly.\r\n<b>Import/export versatility</b>: Transfer your contacts freely between devices and services.\r\n<b>Backup and sync</b>: Securely integrate your contacts with Google for peace of mind.\r\n\r\n<b>Caller ID & Spam Protection:</b>\r\nCaller ID: Identify unknown callers and block spammers, even without internet access.\r\nPrivacy security: Say goodbye to robocalls and maintain your peace of mind.\r\n\r\n<b>Favorites & Call Log Accessibility:</b>\r\nSpeed dial: Quickly connect with your favorite contacts with a single tap.\r\nSmart call log: Instantly access your recent calls, grouped for convenience.\r\nHome screen shortcuts: Dial your frequent contacts directly from the home screen.\r\n\r\n<b>Advanced T9 Dialer:</b>\r\nFast search: Quickly find contacts and calls with our lightning-fast T9 search.\r\nIntelligent grouping: Organize your recent calls for easy access.\r\nMultilingual support: Our dialer is fluent in multiple languages.\r\n\r\n<b>Customizable & Modern Design:</b>\r\nClutter-free interface: Focus solely on your contacts and calls.\r\nTheme personalization: Customize the look with various themes.\r\nDual SIM support: Effortlessly manage two lines in one app.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\r\nPhone Dialer Manager: Manage, link, delete, and recover contacts, create groups, and sync with Google accounts.\r\nGet Connect call screen: Customize your phone dialer screen and enjoy the iOS 15 call screen features.\r\nEasy Dialer: Access calls and contacts with one-hand navigation and experience unique features with a built-in theme manager.\r\n\r\n<b>Join the Revolution in Calling Technology:</b>\r\nPhone Dialer & Contacts is more than a dialer \u2013 it's your comprehensive communication hub. Download now and redefine your calling experience with Samsung!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Upgrade Your Calling Experience with Samsung&#39;s Phone Dialer &amp; Contacts!</b> \ud83d\udcf2<br><br>Transform your phone app experience with Samsung&#39;s official Phone Dialer &amp; Contacts tool. Embrace efficiency and style in managing your contacts and calls.<br><br><b>Effortless Contact Management:</b><br><br><b>One-stop shop</b>: Easily view, edit, call, and add new contacts in a single place.<br><b>Powerful suggestions</b>: Keep your contact list organized and up-to-date.<br><b>Social connectivity</b>: Seamlessly connect with friends across various platforms.<br><b>Merge and clean</b>: Combine duplicate contacts and remove unwanted ones effortlessly.<br><b>Import/export versatility</b>: Transfer your contacts freely between devices and services.<br><b>Backup and sync</b>: Securely integrate your contacts with Google for peace of mind.<br><br><b>Caller ID &amp; Spam Protection:</b><br>Caller ID: Identify unknown callers and block spammers, even without internet access.<br>Privacy security: Say goodbye to robocalls and maintain your peace of mind.<br><br><b>Favorites &amp; Call Log Accessibility:</b><br>Speed dial: Quickly connect with your favorite contacts with a single tap.<br>Smart call log: Instantly access your recent calls, grouped for convenience.<br>Home screen shortcuts: Dial your frequent contacts directly from the home screen.<br><br><b>Advanced T9 Dialer:</b><br>Fast search: Quickly find contacts and calls with our lightning-fast T9 search.<br>Intelligent grouping: Organize your recent calls for easy access.<br>Multilingual support: Our dialer is fluent in multiple languages.<br><br><b>Customizable &amp; Modern Design:</b><br>Clutter-free interface: Focus solely on your contacts and calls.<br>Theme personalization: Customize the look with various themes.<br>Dual SIM support: Effortlessly manage two lines in one app.<br><br><b>Key Features:</b><br><br>Phone Dialer Manager: Manage, link, delete, and recover contacts, create groups, and sync with Google accounts.<br>Get Connect call screen: Customize your phone dialer screen and enjoy the iOS 15 call screen features.<br>Easy Dialer: Access calls and contacts with one-hand navigation and experience unique features with a built-in theme manager.<br><br><b>Join the Revolution in Calling Technology:</b><br>Phone Dialer &amp; Contacts is more than a dialer \u2013 it&#39;s your comprehensive communication hub. Download now and redefine your calling experience with Samsung!",
